; Thorin's remarks
;
; Script handler (op 3, in Thorin's script #R$C90C). Always passes the test
; pass of the script engine (#R$9D44). Then, by a random number A from 0 to 8
; (small values likelier): 0 "Thorin sits down and starts singing about gold",
; 1-2 Thorin says "Hurry up", 3-4 "Thorin wait" (these two as plain text with
; a full stop, #R$97F4), 5 or more nothing.
; .
; The branch for "Get us out of this one, thief !" ($B0D5) cannot be reached:
; it tests Z after a CP 3 that has already sent every A of 3 or more away
; (finding).
; .
; Hardware: none (the text goes through the message printer).
@label=ThorinTalks
c$A657 CALL $9D44
 $A65A LD A,$08      ; random 0 to 8
 $A65C CALL $9C9F
 $A65F CP $05        ; 5 or more: silent
 $A661 RET NC
 $A662 CP $03        ; 3 or 4:
 $A664 LD HL,$B0F4   ; "Thorin wait"
 $A667 JP NC,$97F4
 $A66A LD HL,$B0D5   ; "Get us out of this one, thief !" (never reached)
 $A66D JP Z,$A1E3    ; Z cannot hold here: A is below 3 and not 3
 $A670 LD HL,$B0E5   ; "Thorin sits down and starts singing about gold"
 $A673 CP $00
 $A675 JP Z,$97F4
 $A678 LD HL,$B05B   ; 1 or 2: "Hurry up"
 $A67B JP $A1E3
